msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "第"
msgstr "Position "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "位还没选"
msgstr " is not selected"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "位：模板 "
msgstr ": template "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid " 应该配 "
msgstr " should pair with "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "，你选了 "
msgstr "; you chose "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "互补链：<span class=\"ok\">T A C G</span>（从 3′ 端读到 5′ 端）。四个位置都满足 A-T、C-G，两条链能稳定扣在一起。"
msgstr ""
"Complementary strand: <span class=\"ok\">T A C G</span> (read from 3′ to 5′). All four positions "
"follow A–T and C–G pairing."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "你的互补链：<span class=\"bad\">"
msgstr "Your complementary strand: <span class=\"bad\">"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "</span>。还没稳定：<br>"
msgstr "</span>. Pairing is incomplete:<br>"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "当前互补链："
msgstr "Current complementary strand: "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "继续把四个位置选完。"
msgstr "Select a letter at all four positions."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "配对练习"
msgstr "Pairing practice"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "模板链：5′ A T G C 3′"
msgstr "Template strand: 5′ A T G C 3′"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "在四个位置各点一个字母，组成对面的互补链。选错没关系，看结果区的提示再改。"
msgstr ""
"Choose one letter at each position to build the complementary strand. Use the feedback to revise "
"incorrect choices."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "第1位"
msgstr "Position 1"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "A 配 ?"
msgstr "A pairs with ?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "第2位"
msgstr "Position 2"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "T 配 ?"
msgstr "T pairs with ?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "第3位"
msgstr "Position 3"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "G 配 ?"
msgstr "G pairs with ?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "第4位"
msgstr "Position 4"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "C 配 ?"
msgstr "C pairs with ?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "还没选字母：请在四个位置各点一个字母。"
msgstr "No letters selected. Choose one at each position."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-practice"
msgid "清空重来"
msgstr "Clear and restart"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">原始双链：两条旧链靠配对扣在一起</p>"
msgstr ""
"<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Original double strand: the two existing strands are "
"paired</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "旧链 5′"
msgstr "Existing strand 5′"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "旧链 3′"
msgstr "Existing strand 3′"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "现在是一个完整的双链 DNA。两条旧链面对面，碱基按 A-T、C-G 扣在一起。"
msgstr "This is one double-stranded DNA molecule. The existing strands pair through A–T and C–G."

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">第一步：双链解开</p>"
msgstr "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Step 1: separate the strands</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "双链分开了，两条旧链的碱基都露出来，等待新伙伴补上。"
msgstr "The strands separate, exposing their bases for complementary pairing."

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">第二步：每条旧链当模板，新链按规则补上</p>"
msgstr "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Step 2: use each existing strand as a template</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "新链 3′"
msgstr "New strand 3′"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "新链 5′"
msgstr "New strand 5′"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "旧链上是 A 就补 T，是 T 就补 A，是 C 就补 G，是 G 就补 C。每条旧链都配出了一条新链。"
msgstr ""
"Add T opposite A, A opposite T, G opposite C, and C opposite G. Each template now has a new "
"complementary strand."

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">第三步：得到两个相同的双链</p>"
msgstr "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Step 3: two identical double strands</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">双链 1（旧 + 新）</p>"
msgstr "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Double strand 1 (existing + new)</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">双链 2（新 + 旧）</p>"
msgstr "<div class=\"pair\"><p class=\"caption\">Double strand 2 (new + existing)</p>"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "复制完成：两个双链的序列都和原来一模一样，各含一条旧链和一条新链。"
msgstr ""
"Replication complete: both double strands have the original sequence, each with one existing "
"strand and one new strand."

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "DNA 复制模拟"
msgstr "DNA replication simulation"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "下一步"
msgstr "Next step"

msgctxt "seed:replication-sim"
msgid "重新开始"
msgstr "Restart"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "✔ 配对正确：一大一小正好填满"
msgstr "✔ Correct pair: one large and one small base fit"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "✘ 两个大的并排，挤不下"
msgstr "✘ Two large bases do not fit"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "✘ 两个小的并排，中间留缝"
msgstr "✘ Two small bases leave a gap"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "✘ 大小搭得上，但氢键对不上，扣不稳"
msgstr "✘ The sizes fit, but the hydrogen bonds do not match"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "请为每个位置选一个字母。"
msgstr "Choose a letter at each position."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "有 "
msgstr "There are "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid " 处配错，看每列下方的原因，改选其他字母。"
msgstr " incorrect pairs. Read the reasons below each column and try another letter."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "全对！互补链是 "
msgstr "All correct! The complementary strand is "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "。它由上链唯一决定。"
msgstr ". The template determines it uniquely."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "已选 "
msgstr "Selected "

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid " 个，目前都对，继续。"
msgstr " positions; all correct so far. Continue."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "上面这条链是 A-G-C-T。▣ 表示个头大（A、G），▫ 表示个头小（T、C）。"
msgstr "The template is A–G–C–T. ▣ marks large bases (A, G); ▫ marks small bases (T, C)."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-lab"
msgid "重来"
msgstr "Restart"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "大块"
msgstr "Large block"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "小块"
msgstr "Small block"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "配得上"
msgstr "Fits"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "太挤"
msgstr "Too crowded"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "有空隙"
msgstr "Gap"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "吸点对不上"
msgstr "Bond sites do not match"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "第 {0} 格：上面是 {1}（{2}，需要 {3} 个吸点）。请在下面放一种积木。"
msgstr "Position {0}: the upper base is {1} ({2}, requiring {3} bond sites). Place a block below it."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "第 {0} 格：上 {1}（{2}，{3} 个吸点），下 {4}（{5}，{6} 个吸点）。"
msgstr "Position {0}: upper {1} ({2}, {3} sites), lower {4} ({5}, {6} sites)."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "一大一小，两块加起来刚好撑满两条链之间的距离；吸点 {0} 对 {1}，对得上。✓ 配得上。"
msgstr "One large and one small block fill the gap; {0} and {1} bond sites match. ✓ Fits."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "两块都是大块，加起来比两条链之间的距离还高，下面那块会挤进上面那块。✗ 太挤，放不下。"
msgstr "Two large blocks overlap: their combined height exceeds the gap. ✗ They do not fit."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "两块都是小块，加起来不够高，中间留下空隙，吸点够不着对方。✗ 有空隙，吸不住。"
msgstr "Two small blocks leave a gap, so their bond sites cannot meet. ✗ They do not fit."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "一大一小，宽度刚好；但 {0} 需要 {1} 个吸点，{2} 只能提供 {3} 个，吸点对不上。✗ 吸不住。"
msgstr "The sizes fit, but {0} needs {1} bond sites and {2} provides {3}. ✗ The sites do not match."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "上链（固定）"
msgstr "Upper strand (fixed)"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "下链（由你放）"
msgstr "Lower strand (your blocks)"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "选第 {0} 格"
msgstr "Select position {0}"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "第 {0} 格已放 {1}，点击重选"
msgstr "Position {0} contains {1}; click to replace"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "✓ 配得上"
msgstr "✓ Fits"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "✗ 太挤"
msgstr "✗ Too crowded"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "✗ 有空隙"
msgstr "✗ Gap"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "✗ 吸点"
msgstr "✗ Bond sites"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid " 个吸点"
msgstr " bond sites"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "对不上"
msgstr "Does not match"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid ""
"上链　　　　　　　　{0}\n"
"你放的下链　　　　　{1}\n"
"下链再配一遍　　　　{2}\n"
"与上链相同吗　　　　{3}\n"
"\n"
"已放 {4}/{5} 格，其中配得上 {6} 格。\n"
msgstr ""
"Upper strand: {0} | Your lower strand: {1} | Complement of lower strand: {2} | Matches upper "
"strand: {3} | Filled {4}/{5}, with {6} matching pairs."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "全部配对正确：把下链再配一遍，得到的正好是上链。一条链决定了另一条，所以丢了一条也能重建。"
msgstr ""
"All pairs match. Complementing the lower strand reconstructs the upper strand. Either strand "
"determines the other."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "有 {0} 格配错：再配一遍后，这些格子和上链不同（✗）。配错的那一格里，原来的信息丢了。"
msgstr "{0} pairs are incorrect. Complementing them produces positions that differ from the original (✗)."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "放满所有格子后，这里会告诉你能不能回到上链。"
msgstr "Fill all positions to check whether the upper strand can be reconstructed."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "{0}<small>{1}·{2}吸点</small>"
msgstr "{0}<small>{1} · {2} bond sites</small>"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "放 {0}，{1}，{2}个吸点"
msgstr "Place {0}, {1}, {2} bond sites"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "拼出对面那条链"
msgstr "Build the complementary strand"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "拼出对面那条链：每一格只有一种积木放得上"
msgstr "Build the complementary strand: only one block fits each position"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "学习问题：上面这条链每一格都固定了，对面这一格放哪种积木才能配上？放错了，到底卡在哪里？"
msgstr "Which block fits opposite each fixed base? What prevents an incorrect block from fitting?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "选一条上链"
msgstr "Select an upper strand"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "自己输入…"
msgstr "Enter your own…"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "自己输入（A T G C，最多 8 个）"
msgstr "Your sequence (A T G C, up to 8 letters)"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "显示正确答案"
msgstr "Show correct answer"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "清空下链"
msgstr "Clear lower strand"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "1. 先选一格，再放积木"
msgstr "1. Select a position, then place a block"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "点下链的虚线空位选格（带粗边框的是当前格），再点下面的积木。大块＝高 2 格的积木（A、G）；小块＝高 1 格的积木（T、C）。每种积木还有不同的纹理，不只靠颜色或字母。"
msgstr ""
"Click a dashed position, then choose a block. Large blocks (A, G) are two units high; small "
"blocks (T, C) are one. Textures distinguish blocks as well as colors and letters."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "2. 两条链面对面"
msgstr "2. The strands face each other"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "中间的短竖线＝很弱的吸引力（吸点）。✓＝配得上，✗＝配不上；配不上的格子用虚线框，并写明原因。"
msgstr ""
"Short vertical marks represent weak bonds. ✓ means a matching pair; ✗ marks a mismatch with a "
"dashed outline and a reason."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "3. 这一格为什么能（不能）配上"
msgstr "3. Why does this pair fit or fail?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "先选一个空位，再放一种积木试试。"
msgstr "Select an empty position and try a block."

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "4. 结果：把你拼的下链再配一遍，能回到上链吗？"
msgstr "4. Does complementing your lower strand reconstruct the upper one?"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "可放入的积木"
msgstr "Available blocks"

msgctxt "seed:pairing-builder"
msgid "上链固定，下链由你放置的积木，中间显示是否配得上"
msgstr "Fixed upper strand and your lower strand, with pairing feedback"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "新"
msgstr "New"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "✗ 配不上"
msgstr "✗ Mismatch"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "第 0 步：原来的一份 DNA"
msgstr "Step 0: the original DNA molecule"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "第 1 步：把两条链拉开"
msgstr "Step 1: separate the two strands"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "第 2 步：每条旧链当模板，对面配上新积木"
msgstr "Step 2: complement each template with new blocks"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "原来的 DNA：上链＋下链"
msgstr "Original DNA: upper + lower strand"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "旧上链（单独一条）"
msgstr "Existing upper strand"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "旧下链（单独一条）"
msgstr "Existing lower strand"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "吸点已断开，两条链分开"
msgstr "Bonds released; strands separated"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "分子 1＝旧上链＋新下链"
msgstr "Molecule 1 = existing upper + new lower"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "分子 2＝新上链＋旧下链"
msgstr "Molecule 2 = new upper + existing lower"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "这是一份 DNA：上链固定，下链是按规则配出来的对应链，两条链靠中间的吸点贴在一起。下链的每一格都能由上链推出来，反过来也成立。"
msgstr ""
"This DNA molecule contains two complementary strands held together by bonds. Either strand "
"determines the other."

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "复制从拉开两条链开始（细胞里有专门的“小工具”做这件事）。现在每条链都只剩一半，但各自仍带着完整的信息：只要知道一条，就知道对面该放什么。"
msgstr ""
"Replication begins by separating the strands. Each strand retains the information needed to "
"construct its complement."

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "每条旧链当模板，对面一格一格放上新积木，规则不变：A 对 T，G 对 C。上面的旧链得到一条新下链，下面的旧链得到一条新上链，于是有了两份 DNA。"
msgstr ""
"Each existing strand serves as a template. A pairs with T and G with C, producing two DNA "
"molecules."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid ""
"\n"
"注意：你让分子 1 的第 {0} 格放了 {1}（该放 {2}），所以这一格配不上。"
msgstr "Notice: position {0} of molecule 1 contains {1} instead of {2}, creating a mismatch."

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "到第 2 步才会产生两份新分子。"
msgstr "Two new molecules appear at step 2."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "原来的 DNA　上链 {0}　下链 {1}\n"
msgstr "Original DNA: upper {0}, lower {1}"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "分子 1　　　上链 {0}　下链 {1}　{2}\n"
msgstr "Molecule 1: upper {0}, lower {1}, {2}"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "✓ 与原来完全相同"
msgstr "✓ Identical to original"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "✗ 与原来不同"
msgstr "✗ Different from original"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid ""
"分子 2　　　上链 {0}　下链 {1}　{2}\n"
"\n"
msgstr "Molecule 2: upper {0}, lower {1}, {2}"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "两份都和原来一模一样：每份是“一条旧链＋一条新链”。因为每一格都只有一种积木放得上，新链是被旧链“决定”出来的，不是随便生成的。"
msgstr ""
"Both copies match the original, each containing one existing and one new strand. Base pairing "
"determines the new sequence."

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid ""
"分子 1 的第 {0} 格配不上，吸不稳。\n"
"如果这里没被修好，下一次复制时带错的新下链会当模板：它对面会放 {1}，而原来这一格是 {2}。\n"
"下一代的上链：{3}　与最初的 {4} 在第 {5} 格不同。\n"
"一格放错，后代的序列就改变了（这是突变的来源之一）。真实细胞有检查和修复机制，这里不展示。"
msgstr ""
"Molecule 1 has a mismatch at position {0}. If unrepaired, its new lower strand becomes a "
"template: it pairs with {1}, whereas the original had {2}. The next upper strand {3} differs from"
" {4} at position {5}. This illustrates one source of mutation; cellular checking and repair are "
"not shown."

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "不放错（按规则配）"
msgstr "No mistake (follow pairing rules)"

#, python-brace-format
msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "第 {0} 格（该放 {1}，故意放 {2}）"
msgstr "Position {0}: place {2} instead of {1}"

msgctxt "seed:replication-lab"
msgid "复制：拉开、各自当模板、再配对"
msgstr "Replicate: separate, use templates, pair"

