msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "用循环求和：total 每一轮怎么变？"
msgstr "Summing in a loop: how does total change?"

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "跟着每一行看：循环变量 n 和累加器 total 在每一轮里分别是多少？"
msgstr "Follow each line to see n and total during every iteration."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "创建一个列表 nums，里面有三个数。"
msgstr "Create a list nums containing three numbers."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "累加器 total 从 0 开始，之后每个数都加到它上面。"
msgstr "Initialize total to 0; each number will be added to it."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "进入循环：n 取列表的第一个数 3。"
msgstr "Enter the loop: n takes the first value, 3."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "total = 0 + 3，所以 total 变成 3。"
msgstr "total = 0 + 3, so total becomes 3."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "回到循环开头：n 取下一个数 5，total 暂时还是 3。"
msgstr "Return to the loop: n becomes 5; total is still 3."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "total = 3 + 5，变成 8。"
msgstr "total = 3 + 5, giving 8."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "n 取最后一个数 2。"
msgstr "n takes the last value, 2."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "total = 8 + 2，变成 10。"
msgstr "total = 8 + 2, giving 10."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "列表里没有下一个数了，循环结束；n 还保留着最后一次的值 2。"
msgstr "No values remain, so the loop ends; n retains its last value, 2."

msgctxt "seed:code-trace"
msgid "循环之外，打印 total：输出 10，等于 3 + 5 + 2。"
msgstr "Outside the loop, print total: 10 = 3 + 5 + 2."

