msgid "统计量：它描述“中心”还是“分散”？"
msgstr "Statistics: does each describe center or spread?"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "把每个统计量放进它回答的问题：数据大概在哪里，还是数据有多散？"
msgstr "Place each statistic under the question it answers: where the data lies or how spread out it is."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "集中趋势"
msgstr "Central tendency"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "数据大概落在哪里"
msgstr "Where the data typically lies"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "离散程度"
msgstr "Dispersion"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "数据有多分散"
msgstr "How spread out the data is"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "平均数"
msgstr "Mean"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "平均数把所有数合成一个“典型值”，描述中心位置，不描述散布。"
msgstr "The mean combines values into a typical central location; it does not measure spread."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "平均数只给出一个中心位置；同一个平均数可以来自很集中、也可以来自很分散的数据。"
msgstr "The same mean can arise from tightly grouped or widely spread data."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "方差"
msgstr "Variance"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "方差是偏差平方的平均，数据越分散它越大，回答的是“有多散”。"
msgstr "Variance averages squared deviations and grows with dispersion."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "方差不告诉你数据在哪里：把所有数都加 10，平均数变了，方差一点没变。"
msgstr "Variance does not locate the data: adding 10 changes the mean but leaves variance unchanged."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "中位数"
msgstr "Median"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "中位数是排好序后正中间的那个数，也是描述中心，而且不容易被极端值带偏。"
msgstr "The median is the middle sorted value, a measure of center less affected by extreme values."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "中位数是一个位置，不衡量散布。"
msgstr "The median is a location, not a measure of spread."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "标准差"
msgstr "Standard deviation"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "标准差是方差开方，单位和原数据相同，衡量典型的偏离距离。"
msgstr ""
"Standard deviation is the square root of variance, measuring typical deviation in the original "
"units."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "标准差衡量偏离均值有多远，它不是中心本身。"
msgstr "Standard deviation measures distance from the mean, not the center itself."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "众数"
msgstr "Mode"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "众数是出现次数最多的值，是另一种“最典型”的值，属于集中趋势。"
msgstr "The mode is the most frequent value, another measure of central tendency."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "众数只看哪个值最常见，和散布无关。"
msgstr "The mode identifies the most common value, not dispersion."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "极差"
msgstr "Range"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "极差 = 最大值 − 最小值，一眼看出数据铺开的范围，是最简单的离散程度。"
msgstr "Range = maximum − minimum, a simple measure of the data's extent."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "极差是两端之间的距离，不是中心的位置。"
msgstr "Range measures distance between extremes, not central location."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "四分位距"
msgstr "Interquartile range"

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "四分位距 = Q3 − Q1，是中间一半数据铺开的宽度，不受极端值影响。"
msgstr "IQR = Q3 − Q1, the width of the middle half of the data, resistant to extreme values."

msgctxt "seed:sort-match"
msgid "四分位距衡量中间一半数据的宽度，不是中心。"
msgstr "IQR measures the width of the middle half, not its center."

