msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "复制一份 DNA：每一格按规则配对"
msgstr "Replicate DNA: follow the pairing rules at each position"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "只靠“A 对 T、G 对 C”这一条规则，为什么能得到两份和原来一样的 DNA？配错一格会怎样？"
msgstr "Why does A–T and G–C pairing yield two copies? What happens after one mismatch?"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "原来的一份 DNA"
msgstr "Original DNA molecule"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "双链 DNA 由两条链配对而成：上链的 A 对着 T，T 对着 A，G 对着 C，C 对着 G。"
msgstr "Double-stranded DNA consists of complementary strands: A pairs with T and G pairs with C."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "原 DNA 上链"
msgstr "Original upper strand"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "原 DNA 下链"
msgstr "Original lower strand"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "两条链拉开，各自当模板"
msgstr "Separate the strands; use each as a template"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "解旋酶把两条链拉开。每条旧链都露出一排没配对的碱基，等着配新链。"
msgstr "Helicase separates the strands, exposing unpaired bases for new complementary strands."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "旧链甲（当模板）"
msgstr "Template strand A"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链甲"
msgstr "New strand A"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "旧链乙（当模板）"
msgstr "Template strand B"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链乙"
msgstr "New strand B"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链甲：按规则配"
msgstr "New strand A: follow the pairing rules"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链甲逐格配对：旧链甲是 A 就配 T，是 T 就配 A，是 G 就配 C，是 C 就配 G。"
msgstr "Complement template A position by position: A–T, T–A, G–C and C–G."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链乙：同样按规则配"
msgstr "New strand B: the same rules"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "另一条旧链也一样当模板，规则没有变。"
msgstr "The other existing strand is also a template, with the same rules."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "得到两份相同的 DNA"
msgstr "Two identical DNA molecules"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "每份 DNA 都是“一条旧链 + 一条新链”。两份的碱基顺序和原来完全一样，这叫半保留复制。"
msgstr ""
"Each copy has one existing and one new strand, retaining the original sequence: semiconservative "
"replication."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "DNA① 上链（旧）"
msgstr "DNA 1 upper (existing)"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "DNA① 下链（新）"
msgstr "DNA 1 lower (new)"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "DNA② 上链（新）"
msgstr "DNA 2 upper (new)"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "DNA② 下链（旧）"
msgstr "DNA 2 lower (existing)"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "下一轮：用 DNA① 的下链当模板"
msgstr "Next round: use DNA 1's lower strand as a template"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "再复制一轮时，DNA① 的下链也要当模板。它是什么，新配出的链就是什么。"
msgstr "During another round, DNA 1's lower strand determines its new complement."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "模板（DNA① 下链）"
msgstr "Template (DNA 1 lower)"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新配的上链"
msgstr "New upper strand"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "和最初的上链比"
msgstr "Compare with original upper strand"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "一致"
msgstr "Same"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "在这一步故意出错"
msgstr "Introduce a mistake at this step"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "错配的一格留在了新链里，它再被拿去当模板，错误就被抄给下一代。"
msgstr ""
"An unrepaired mismatch remains in the new strand; using it as a template can pass a sequence "
"change to the next generation."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链甲：第 4 格配错了"
msgstr "New strand A: mismatch at position 4"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "旧链甲第 4 格是 C，应该配 G，这里却放了 A。A 只能配 T，这一格配不上。"
msgstr "Template A has C at position 4 and should pair with G, but A was placed here. This is a mismatch."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "新链乙：照常配对"
msgstr "New strand B: normal pairing"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "另一条链配对没有问题，错误只在新链甲里。"
msgstr "The other strand pairs normally; the error is confined to new strand A."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "得到两份 DNA，其中一份有错配"
msgstr "Two DNA molecules, one with a mismatch"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "DNA① 的上下链在第 4 格对不上（C 对 A）。DNA② 是好的。细胞里的修复系统有机会发现它，但这里假设没被修复。"
msgstr ""
"DNA 1 has C opposite A at position 4. DNA 2 is correct. Cells may repair this, but the example "
"assumes no repair."

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "下一轮：错的链当模板"
msgstr "Next round: the incorrect strand becomes a template"

msgctxt "seed:step-process"
msgid "这条下链第 4 格是 A，所以新配出的上链这一格是 T，而不是原来的 C。"
msgstr "Its fourth base is A, so its new complement has T rather than the original C."

