msgctxt "seed:timeline-lanes"
msgid "下载三个文件：同步和异步差在哪？"
msgstr "Downloading three files: synchronous or asynchronous?"

msgctxt "seed:timeline-lanes"
msgid "每个下载都要等 2 秒网络。为什么异步总共不是 6 秒而是约 3 秒？"
msgstr ""
"Each download waits two seconds for the network. Why does the asynchronous case take about three "
"seconds rather than six?"

