msgid "前进到复制的下一个阶段（共四个阶段，到最后回到开头）"
msgstr "Advance through the four stages, returning to the start after the last."

msgid "重新开始"
msgstr "Restart"

msgid "回到第一个阶段（原始双链）"
msgstr "Return to the original double strand."

msgid "给 AGCT 配互补链（含错配原因）"
msgstr "Complement AGCT"

msgid "上链 A-G-C-T 固定（标出大块 A、G 和小块 T、C），学习者给每一列选一个字母；配错时在该列下方说明是「两个大块挤不下」「两个小块有缝」还是「大小搭得上但吸点对不上」。"
msgstr "Choose bases and inspect size and hydrogen-bond compatibility."

msgid "给上面一条链的每个字母选对面的字母，配错时会出什么问题？"
msgstr "Why do some base pairs fit while others fail?"

msgid "每列的 A / T / G / C 按钮"
msgstr "Base buttons"

msgid "为该列选对面的字母，立刻显示配对是否正确及原因"
msgstr "Select a complementary base in each column and inspect feedback."

msgid "重来"
msgstr "Restart"

msgid "清空所有选择"
msgstr "Clear all selections."

msgid "拼出对面那条链：积木大小与吸点"
msgstr "Build the complementary strand"

